                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0,
                            "playtime_at_review": 58,
                            "last_played": 1672310712
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I first reviewed this game back in 2020 and unfortunately controller support was broken. At first when I started playing my Xbox One controller was working with no issues then all of a sudden it just wasn't working right. I was able to move around normally with the left analog stick as well as roll when I hit the trigger button, but I was unable to scroll menus and my character is continuously attacking left by itself. \n\nHere we are in 2022 and I wanted to see if things were fixed since I noticed the game was on sale. I tried using different Xbox controllers since I got one after my initial review and unfortunately nothing has changed and controller support is still broken. I can still move around with my left analog stick, but it's continuing to shoot by itself one direction constantly, although this time it's right instead of left. lol If I come back in 2 more years I wonder if it will be aiming up or down?\n\nI do want to mention you can play with keyboard and mouse, but it just feels extremely awkward with how attacking works in this game. Till controller support is fixed and/or the way attacking works I would definitely not purchase this even in a deep sale.",
